From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LIVI appliance
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:15:00 +1030
Subject: [PATCH] media: cedrus: add the H616 variant

Backport of the upstream series patch: the H616 video engine uses the
H6 variant data (H.264 and HEVC decode; the H616 also has a VP9 decoder
the driver has no support for yet). This is what makes the video-codec
node in 0003 probe as /dev/video0 and the GStreamer v4l2 stateless
decoders usable.
---
 drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

--- a/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c
+++ b/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c
@@ -700,6 +700,10 @@
 		.compatible = "allwinner,sun50i-h6-video-engine",
 		.data = &sun50i_h6_cedrus_variant,
 	},
+	{
+		.compatible = "allwinner,sun50i-h616-video-engine",
+		.data = &sun50i_h6_cedrus_variant,
+	},
 	{ /* sentinel */ }
 };
 MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(of, cedrus_dt_match);
